ciency_per_w": null}, {"id": "qpd_backscatter_detection.PD2", "type": "photodiode", "label": "Trap 2 lens-focused QPD", "group": "qpd_backscatter_detection", "part_number": "PDQ80A", "beam": "qpd_backscatter_detection.L1.r.t", "distance_mm": 100.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": null, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": null, "fast_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": null, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}], "targets": [{"element_id": "laser_source_1064.FC1", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 1500.0}, {"element_id": "laser_source_1064.FC1", "kind": "min_coupling", "value": 0.65}, {"element_id": "laser_source_1064.PD1", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 20.0}, {"element_id": "dual_trap_interferometer.FC1", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 450.0}, {"element_id": "dual_trap_interferometer.FC2", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 450.0}, {"element_id": "dual_trap_interferometer.PD1", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 5.0}, {"element_id": "relay_and_objective_launch.FC1", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 350.0}, {"element_id": "relay_and_objective_launch.FC2", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 15.0}, {"element_id": "relay_and_objective_launch.PD1", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 5.0}, {"element_id": "qpd_backscatter_detection.PD1", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 8.0}, {"element_id": "qpd_backscatter_detection.PD2", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 8.0}, {"element_id": "qpd_backscatter_detection.PD3", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 0.5}, {"element_id": "qpd_backscatter_detection.PD4", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 0.5}], "notes": "[laser_source_1064] Compact folded linear layout: main conditioning path runs along +x at y=180 mm (ISO1 -> -50/+100 mm 2x Galilean expander -> 5% sampler S1 to PD1 -> HWP1+PBS1 power control with BD1 dump). Two 90-degree steering mirrors M1 and M2 fold the beam down to y=60 mm along -x through a 0.5x mode-matching lens pair (LENS3 f=+100 mm, LENS4 f=-50 mm) into fiber coupler FC1 (f=4.5 mm, MFD=6.2 um for PM980-XP/PM1064 fiber at 1064 nm, matched waist w=0.52 mm -> >98% coupling efficiency, ~2.4 W coupled).\n[dual_trap_interferometer] U-shaped layout: L1 enters at (50, 70) heading +x (0 deg), expands 2x via LENS1 (-50 mm) and LENS2 (+100 mm) separated by 50 mm (w = 1.30 mm, matched to f=11 mm fiber couplers with MFD=5.8 um for >82% coupling efficiency). S1 picks off 2% (36 mW) to PD1. HWP1 (22.5 deg) + PBS1 splits 882 mW into Trap 1 (H, transmitted) and 882 mW into Trap 2 (V, reflected). Trap 1 folds via M1 and M2 to the upper return path at y=280 heading -x (180 deg) through PBS2; Trap 2 steers via M3 (320, 160), M4 (390, 160), M6 (390, 220), and M7 (320, 220) into PBS2 from below (90 deg) and reflects into the -x return path overlapped with Trap 1. HWP2 (45 deg) swaps H<->V before PBS3 so Trap 1 reflects down to M5 and exits left into FC1 at (60, 190), while Trap 2 transmits straight into FC2 at (60, 280), placing all inputs and outputs on the left side of the U-fold.\n[relay_and_objective_launch] Set out_direction_deg=-90.0 on M1 so the relay beam folds downward to M2. Replaced the cramped LENS4/LENS5 and LENS3/LENS6 sub-telescopes with direct mode-matched f=11.0 mm fiber couplers (PAF2-11C, w_f=3.1 um -> ideal input waist 1.20 mm vs 1.24 mm relay output waist), eliminating mount collisions while exceeding coupling targets.\n[qpd_backscatter_detection] U-shaped layout: Fiber collimator L1 launches at (45, 45) along +x to M1 (390, 45), which folds +y to M2 (390, 225) and folds back along -x (180 deg) so both the fiber launch and the QPD detectors (PD1, PD2 at x=70) sit on the left side of the 450x300 mm baseplate. PBS1 separates Trap 1 (H, transmitted along y=225) and Trap 2 (V, reflected down to M3 at y=135 and folded along -x). BS1 and BS2 pick off 10% (2 mW each) to reference photodiodes PD3 and PD4, while LENS1 and LENS2 (f=100 mm) focus the remaining 90% (18 mW each) onto quadrant photodiodes PD1 and PD2 placed at the back focal planes."}, "report": {"passed": true, "score": 99.48041739292182, "checks": [{"id": "no_light", "severity": "info", "message": "relay_and_objective_launch.BD1 receives no light", "element_id": "relay_and_objective_launch.BD1", "segment_id": null, "value": null, "limit": null}, {"id": "no_light", "severity": "info", "message": "relay_and_objective_launch.BD2 receives no light", "element_id": "relay_and_objective_launch.BD2", "segment_id": null, "value": null, "limit": null}, {"id": "target", "severity": "info", "message": "met: laser_source_1064.FC1: 2339.240 mW (need \u2265 1500.000)", "element_id": "laser_source_1064.FC1", "segment_id": null, "value": 2339.2399215642413, "limit": 1500.0}, {"id": "target", "severity": "info", "message": "met: laser_source_1064.FC1: coupling 95.6% (need \u2265 65.0%)", "element_id": "laser_source_1064.FC1", "segment_id": null, "value": 0.9562127351423055, "limit": 0.65}, {"id": "target", "severity": "info", "message": "met: laser_source_1064.PD1: 138.000 mW (need \u2265 20.000)", "element_id": "laser_source_1064.PD1", "segment_id": null, "value": 138.0, "limit": 20.0}, {"id": "target", "severity": "info", "message": "met: dual_trap_interferometer.FC1: 865.162 mW (need \u2265 450.000)", "element_id": "dual_trap_interferometer.FC1", "segment_id": null, "value": 865.1622366998644, "limit": 450.0}, {"id": "target", "severity": "info", "message": "met: dual_trap_interferometer.FC2: 871.026 mW (need \u2265 450.000)", "element_id": "dual_trap_interferometer.FC2", "segment_id": null, "value": 871.0260794388033, "limit": 450.0}, {"id": "target", "severity": "info", "message": "met: dual_trap_interferometer.PD1: 36.000 mW (need \u2265 5.000)", "element_id": "dual_trap_interferometer.PD1", "segment_id": null, "value": 36.0, "limit": 5.0}, {"id": "target", "se